# Delirium - "four or more card types among cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c): Bot1's graveyard holds a Culling the Weak (instant)
# and the Ornithopter it sacrificed (artifact, creature): three types, one short. Bot2's graveyard holds a Forest (land) discarded to
# Mox Diamond, which is not Bot1's graveyard. Impossible Inferno kills Bot1's own Dryad Arbor (a land creature, 1/1): a land, the
# fourth type, but the Arbor is put into the graveyard only after the Inferno has finished resolving (CR 704.3), so nothing is
# exiled; the top card of Bot1's library stays where it is.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Culling the Weak
Impossible Inferno
Dryad Arbor
Island
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Diamond
Forest
Island x14

